# Release signing (issue 05: NEVER commit a keystore or any password).
# keystore.properties is read by scripts/with-android-signing.js from the repo
# root (prebuild-safe; android/ is wiped by `expo prebuild`) — explicit
# entries keep both candidate paths ignored even if android/ is ever
# committed. Generation + backup walkthrough: docs/release-android.md
/keystore.properties
/android/keystore.properties

